  "releaseNotes": "1.4.4\n        - No change in the controls. Released so the family keeps one version with G9LynxControls 1.4.4, its Lynx port,\n        which ships Lynx-side fixes (the port's version always equals the G9MAUIControls release it is pinned to).\n\n        Earlier versions: https://github.com/ImanKari/G9MAUIControls/blob/main/CHANGELOG.md",
